Output assets/fastapi-url-demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 960
Set Height 420
Set Shell bash
Set Theme "Dracula"
Type "fastapi-url serve --port 8000"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "   ✓ JWT auth · Database · React dashboard"
Enter
Type "   ✓ API: http://localhost:8000/docs"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "# URL shortener · JWT · click tracking · FastAPI"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
